const SCHEMAS={settings:['id','key','value','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],admins:['id','username','passwordHash','salt','failedAttempts','lockedUntil','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],profile:['id','name','title','introduction','about','email','phone','address','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],education:['id','institution','qualification','startYear','endYear','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],experience:['id','company','position','employmentType','startDate','endDate','location','responsibilities','technologies','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],skills:['id','name','category','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],projects:['id','name','projectType','courseName','year','shortDescription','fullDescription','objective','role','solution','techStack','features','skillsLearned','githubUrl','demoUrl','coverImageId','documentationId','featured','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],project_images:['id','projectId','driveFileId','caption','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],certifications:['id','name','shortName','issuer','issuedDate','expirationDate','credentialId','credentialUrl','documentId','description','skills','publicDocument','featured','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],awards:['id','name','issuer','issuedDate','description','documentId','publicDocument','featured','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],social_links:['id','platform','url','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],documents:['id','name','kind','driveFileId','mimeType','publicDocument','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder'],audit_logs:['id','timestamp','admin','action','targetType','targetId','userAgent','result','createdAt','updatedAt','visibility','sortOrder']};
const SESSION_TTL=21600,MAX_ATTEMPTS=5,LOCK_SECONDS=900;
function setupPortfolioSystem(){const p=PropertiesService.getScriptProperties();['SPREADSHEET_ID','ADMIN_USERNAME','ADMIN_INITIAL_PASSWORD','SESSION_SECRET'].forEach(k=>{if(!p.getProperty(k))throw new Error('Missing Script Property: '+k)});setupPortfolioDatabase();if(!p.getProperty('DRIVE_FOLDER_ID'))p.setProperty('DRIVE_FOLDER_ID',DriveApp.createFolder('Portfolio Documents').getId());seedPortfolio_();seedAdmin_();const result={ok:true,sheets:Object.keys(SCHEMAS),message:'Setup complete. Change the initial password after first login.'};console.log(JSON.stringify(result,null,2));return result}
function setupPortfolioDatabase(){const ss=spreadsheet_();Object.entries(SCHEMAS).forEach(([name,headers])=>{let s=ss.getSheetByName(name);if(!s)s=ss.insertSheet(name);if(!s.getLastRow())s.appendRow(headers);else{const current=s.getRange(1,1,1,s.getLastColumn()).getValues()[0];if(headers.some((h,i)=>current[i]!==h))throw new Error('Header mismatch: '+name)}})}
function doGet(e){try{if(e.parameter.action==='document')return document_(e);return json_(true,publicPortfolio_())}catch(err){return json_(false,null,safe_(err))}}
function doPost(e){try{const body=JSON.parse(e.postData?.contents||'{}'),action=String(body.action||'');if(action==='getPortfolio')return json_(true,publicPortfolio_());if(action==='login')return json_(true,login_(body.payload||{},e));if(action==='logout')return json_(true,logout_(body.token,e));const session=session_(body.token),handlers={getDashboard:dashboard_,adminList:list_,adminSave:save_,adminDelete:remove_,changePassword:changePassword_,uploadDocument:upload_};if(!handlers[action])throw new Error('Unknown action');return json_(true,handlers[action](body.payload||{},session,e))}catch(err){return json_(false,null,safe_(err))}}
function publicPortfolio_(){const c=CacheService.getScriptCache(),hit=c.get('public:v1');if(hit)return JSON.parse(hit);const rows=n=>read_(n).filter(r=>r.visibility==='public').sort((a,b)=>Number(a.sortOrder)-Number(b.sortOrder));const profile=rows('profile')[0]||null;if(profile){delete profile.phone;delete profile.address}const data={profile,education:rows('education'),experience:rows('experience'),projects:rows('projects'),certifications:rows('certifications').map(r=>bool_(r.publicDocument)?r:{...r,documentId:''}),skills:rows('skills'),socialLinks:rows('social_links'),documents:rows('documents').filter(r=>bool_(r.publicDocument)).map(r=>({...r,driveFileId:''})),languages:[{name:'Thai',level:'Native Speaker'},{name:'English',level:'Conversational'}],lastUpdated:new Date().toISOString()};c.put('public:v1',JSON.stringify(data),1200);return data}
function login_(p,e){const username=clean_(p.username,120),password=String(p.password||''),cache=CacheService.getScriptCache(),rate='rate:'+digest_(username.toLowerCase()),count=Number(cache.get(rate)||0)+1;cache.put(rate,String(count),600);if(count>15)throw new Error('Too many login attempts');const admin=read_('admins').find(r=>String(r.username).toLowerCase()===username.toLowerCase());if(!admin||admin.lockedUntil&&new Date(admin.lockedUntil)>new Date()||hash_(password,admin?.salt)!==admin?.passwordHash){if(admin){const tries=Number(admin.failedAttempts||0)+1;update_('admins',admin.id,{failedAttempts:tries,lockedUntil:tries>=MAX_ATTEMPTS?new Date(Date.now()+LOCK_SECONDS*1000).toISOString():''})}audit_(username||'anonymous','FAILED_LOGIN','admin',admin?.id||'',e,'rejected');throw new Error('Invalid credentials or account temporarily locked')}update_('admins',admin.id,{failedAttempts:0,lockedUntil:''});const token=Utilities.getUuid()+Utilities.getUuid(),record={adminId:admin.id,username:admin.username,expiresAt:Date.now()+SESSION_TTL*1000};cache.put('session:'+digest_(token),JSON.stringify(record),SESSION_TTL);audit_(username,'LOGIN','admin',admin.id,e,'success');return{token,expiresAt:new Date(record.expiresAt).toISOString()}}
function session_(token){if(!token)throw new Error('Authentication required');const value=CacheService.getScriptCache().get('session:'+digest_(token));if(!value)throw new Error('Session expired');const s=JSON.parse(value);if(Date.now()>s.expiresAt)throw new Error('Session expired');return s}
function logout_(token,e){const s=session_(token);CacheService.getScriptCache().remove('session:'+digest_(token));audit_(s.username,'LOGOUT','admin',s.adminId,e,'success');return{ok:true}}
function dashboard_(){const count=n=>read_(n).length;return{projects:count('projects'),certifications:count('certifications'),experiences:count('experience'),skills:count('skills'),recentActivity:read_('audit_logs').slice(-10).reverse()}}
function list_(p){return read_(module_(p.module))}
function save_(p,s,e){const m=module_(p.module);if(['admins','audit_logs'].includes(m))throw new Error('Read-only module');const input=p.record||{},current=input.id?read_(m).find(r=>r.id===input.id):null,now=new Date().toISOString(),record={...input,id:current?.id||Utilities.getUuid(),createdAt:current?.createdAt||now,updatedAt:now,visibility:input.visibility==='public'?'public':'private',sortOrder:Number(input.sortOrder||999)};upsert_(m,Object.fromEntries(SCHEMAS[m].map(k=>[k,record[k]??''])));invalidate_();audit_(s.username,current?'UPDATE':'CREATE',m,record.id,e,'success');return record}
function remove_(p,s,e){const m=module_(p.module);if(['admins','audit_logs'].includes(m))throw new Error('Read-only module');delete_(m,String(p.id||''));invalidate_();audit_(s.username,'DELETE',m,p.id,e,'success');return{ok:true}}
function changePassword_(p,s,e){const admin=read_('admins').find(r=>r.id===s.adminId);if(!admin||hash_(String(p.currentPassword||''),admin.salt)!==admin.passwordHash)throw new Error('Current password is incorrect');const next=String(p.newPassword||'');if(next.length<12)throw new Error('Use at least 12 characters');const salt=Utilities.getUuid();update_('admins',admin.id,{salt,passwordHash:hash_(next,salt),updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()});audit_(s.username,'PASSWORD_CHANGE','admin',admin.id,e,'success');return{ok:true}}
function upload_(p,s,e){const allowed=['application/pdf','image/jpeg','image/png','image/webp'],mime=String(p.mimeType||'');if(!allowed.includes(mime))throw new Error('Unsupported file type');const bytes=Utilities.base64Decode(String(p.base64||''));if(bytes.length>8*1024*1024)throw new Error('File exceeds 8 MB');const file=DriveApp.getFolderById(PropertiesService.getScriptProperties().getProperty('DRIVE_FOLDER_ID')).createFile(Utilities.newBlob(bytes,mime,clean_(p.name,160))),now=new Date().toISOString(),r={id:Utilities.getUuid(),name:clean_(p.name,160),kind:clean_(p.kind,40),driveFileId:file.getId(),mimeType:mime,publicDocument:false,createdAt:now,updatedAt:now,visibility:'private',sortOrder:999};upsert_('documents',r);audit_(s.username,'UPLOAD_DOCUMENT','documents',r.id,e,'success');return r}
function document_(e){const r=read_('documents').find(x=>x.id===e.parameter.id);if(!r||r.visibility!=='public'||!bool_(r.publicDocument))return ContentService.createTextOutput('Document not found or private');const blob=DriveApp.getFileById(r.driveFileId).getBlob();return ContentService.createTextOutput(Utilities.base64Encode(blob.getBytes())).setMimeType(ContentService.MimeType.TEXT)}
function seedAdmin_(){if(read_('admins').length)return;const p=PropertiesService.getScriptProperties(),salt=Utilities.getUuid(),now=new Date().toISOString();upsert_('admins',{id:Utilities.getUuid(),username:p.getProperty('ADMIN_USERNAME'),passwordHash:hash_(p.getProperty('ADMIN_INITIAL_PASSWORD'),salt),salt,failedAttempts:0,lockedUntil:'',createdAt:now,updatedAt:now,visibility:'private',sortOrder:1})}
function seedPortfolio_(){if(read_('profile').length)return;const now=new Date().toISOString(),base={createdAt:now,updatedAt:now,visibility:'public'};upsert_('profile',{...base,id:'profile',sortOrder:1,name:'Mr. Chayon Tubsoro',title:'Network Engineering Student',introduction:'Motivated and detail-oriented Network Engineering student with hands-on internship experience in network deployment and maintenance.',about:'Certified in MTCNA, with a strong commitment to learning and contributing to team success. Eager to apply technical skills and problem-solving abilities to support reliable network operations in a professional setting.',email:'chayan.tub@gmail.com',phone:'',address:''});[['Prince of Songkla University, Phuket Campus','Bachelor of Science in Computing, College of Computing','2023','Present'],['Bhavana Bodhigun Vocational College, Koh Samui','Vocational Certificate - Business Computer','2020','2022'],['Hatyaiwittayalai Somboonkulkanya School','High school','2018','2020']].forEach((r,i)=>upsert_('education',{...base,id:'edu-'+(i+1),sortOrder:i+1,institution:r[0],qualification:r[1],startYear:r[2],endYear:r[3]}));upsert_('experience',{...base,id:'exp-1',sortOrder:1,company:'Piromid Solutions, Koh Samui',position:'Network Engineer',employmentType:'Internship',startDate:'2022-05',endDate:'2022-09',location:'Koh Samui',responsibilities:['Communicated with customers','Configured and maintained network systems','Supplied network hardware for outsourcing','Created and designed network systems'],technologies:[]});['Web Application Development','CCNA Network Lab','Server Administrator Lab','CyberSecurity Lab'].forEach((name,i)=>upsert_('projects',{...base,id:'project-'+(i+1),sortOrder:i+1,name,projectType:'Academic Project',courseName:'University Course Project',year:'2023 - Present',shortDescription:'More project details will be added later.',fullDescription:'',objective:'',role:'',solution:'',techStack:[],features:[],skillsLearned:[],githubUrl:'',demoUrl:'',coverImageId:'',documentationId:'',featured:i<2}));upsert_('certifications',{...base,id:'cert-1',sortOrder:1,name:'MikroTik Certified Network Associate',shortName:'MTCNA',issuer:'MikroTik',issuedDate:'2026',expirationDate:'',credentialId:'',credentialUrl:'',documentId:'',description:'',skills:[],publicDocument:false,featured:true});[['Google Workspace','Productivity'],['Microsoft Office','Productivity'],['Network Configuration and Management','Networking'],['HTML','Programming / Web'],['CSS','Programming / Web'],['Bootstrap','Programming / Web'],['JavaScript','Programming / Web'],['React.js','Programming / Web'],['Node.js','Programming / Web'],['Google Cloud/Infrastructure','Cloud / Infrastructure'],['Cisco','Networking'],['MikroTik Router/Switch','Networking']].forEach((r,i)=>upsert_('skills',{...base,id:'skill-'+(i+1),sortOrder:i+1,name:r[0],category:r[1]}));upsert_('documents',{id:'resume',name:'Resume',kind:'resume',driveFileId:'',mimeType:'application/pdf',publicDocument:false,createdAt:now,updatedAt:now,visibility:'private',sortOrder:1})}
function spreadsheet_(){return SpreadsheetApp.openById(PropertiesService.getScriptProperties().getProperty('SPREADSHEET_ID'))}function read_(name){const s=spreadsheet_().getSheetByName(name);if(!s||s.getLastRow()<2)return[];const values=s.getDataRange().getValues(),headers=values.shift();return values.filter(r=>r.some(v=>v!=='')).map(row=>Object.fromEntries(headers.map((h,i)=>[h,parse_(row[i])]))) }function upsert_(name,r){const s=spreadsheet_().getSheetByName(name),headers=SCHEMAS[name],rows=read_(name),i=rows.findIndex(x=>x.id===r.id),values=headers.map(h=>serial_(r[h]));i>=0?s.getRange(i+2,1,1,headers.length).setValues([values]):s.appendRow(values)}function update_(n,id,p){const r=read_(n).find(x=>x.id===id);if(!r)throw new Error('Record not found');upsert_(n,{...r,...p})}function delete_(n,id){const i=read_(n).findIndex(x=>x.id===id);if(i<0)throw new Error('Record not found');spreadsheet_().getSheetByName(n).deleteRow(i+2)}function module_(n){n=String(n||'');if(!SCHEMAS[n])throw new Error('Invalid module');return n}function audit_(admin,action,targetType,targetId,e,result){const now=new Date().toISOString();upsert_('audit_logs',{id:Utilities.getUuid(),timestamp:now,admin,action,targetType,targetId,userAgent:clean_(e?.parameter?.userAgent||'',300),result,createdAt:now,updatedAt:now,visibility:'private',sortOrder:999})}function hash_(password,salt){return Utilities.base64Encode(Utilities.computeDigest(Utilities.DigestAlgorithm.SHA_256,String(salt)+String(password)+PropertiesService.getScriptProperties().getProperty('SESSION_SECRET')))}function digest_(v){return Utilities.base64EncodeWebSafe(Utilities.computeDigest(Utilities.DigestAlgorithm.SHA_256,String(v)))}function clean_(v,m){return String(v||'').replace(/[<>]/g,'').trim().slice(0,m)}function serial_(v){return Array.isArray(v)||typeof v==='object'&&v!==null?JSON.stringify(v):v}function parse_(v){if(typeof v!=='string')return v;try{if(/^[\[{]/.test(v.trim()))return JSON.parse(v)}catch(_){}return v}function bool_(v){return v===true||String(v).toLowerCase()==='true'}function invalidate_(){CacheService.getScriptCache().remove('public:v1')}function safe_(e){console.error(e);return e?.message||'Unexpected server error'}function json_(ok,data,error){return ContentService.createTextOutput(JSON.stringify({ok,data,error:error||null})).setMimeType(ContentService.MimeType.JSON)}
